  ],
  "_comment_steps_assignedToUids": "#192: a step may have several assignees. Team-member routing also queries collectionGroup('steps').where('assignedToUids','array-contains',uid), which needs an ARRAY_CONFIG CONTAINS override at COLLECTION_GROUP scope (an array-contains query cannot use the ASCENDING order index above).",
  "_comment_216_overrides": "#216 Employee Performance (whole-team view): collectionGroup('steps') on completedAt >= x and status == active, and collectionGroup('events') on at within a period ordered by at desc. A field override REPLACES the automatic single-field indexes, so each keeps the COLLECTION ascending/descending pair existing per-matter queries rely on."
